Instill hate in your shadows, strengthening their attacks. They gain [11%, 21%, 28%, 34%, 39% (TL1-5)] extra Accuracy and [17%, 31%, 43%, 52%, 60% (TL1-5)] extra damage. The fury of their attacks gives them the ability to try to Dominate their foes, increasing all damage taken by that foe for 4 turns (level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], [6%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5)] chance at range 1). They also gain the ability to Fade when hit, avoiding all damage until their next turn ([7, 6, 5, 4, 3 (TL1-5)] turn cooldown).
